<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ vehicle registrations rise in May vs April.</title>
<headline>NZ vehicle registrations rise in May vs April.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The total number of vehicle registrations in New Zealand in May was 20,587, up from 19,779 in April but down from 23,070 in May 1996, the Land Transport Safety Authority said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Registrations of new and ex-overseas vehicles totalled 19,107 in May versus 18,295 in April and 21,563 in May 1996.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 473-4746</p>
